## Summary

| What | Language | Reason |
|------|----------|--------|
| Variable names | English | Code consistency, tooling |
| Function names | English | Industry standard |
| Comments | English | Developer documentation |
| File names | English | Codebase navigation |
| Git commits | English | Collaboration |
| Console logs | English | Debugging |
| **UI text** | **Spanish** | **LATAM target users** |
| **Labels** | **Spanish** | **LATAM target users** |
| **Messages** | **Spanish** | **LATAM target users** |
